# AddressSanitizer suppressions for defects in external, unbundled libraries.
#
# Keep this file empty until a report has been confirmed to originate in such a
# library. Do not suppress reports merely because an external header or runtime
# appears at the top of the stack when RDKit supplied the invalid state.
#
# Syntax reference:
#   interceptor_via_fun:function_name
#   interceptor_via_lib:library_name_pattern
